ProjectALife.DialogueShards["barks_heard_1"] = {
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"An alarm! Somebody set off an alarm! Everything will come!","That alarm's going to bring all of them - run!"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=law",{"Alarm - loud, everything within a mile heard that","Alarm going off, we should be somewhere else"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=swat",{"Alarm - withdraw"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=military",{"Alarm! Fall back!"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Shut that alarm off! You'll bring everything!","Alarm! Let's get out of here!","That's free noise, that's free distraction, that's free money","Listen to that, dumb bastards couldn't keep their mouths shut","Someone's alarm went off, wonder what they were hiding","Perfect, let's go see what they're protecting","Somebody's loud, and loud people have stuff","Somebody put a stop to that, I can't think","Shut that thing up before it gets us killed"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","",{"Alarm! Somebody tripped an alarm!","There's an alarm going off, can you hear that?","Who the hell set off the alarm?","Turn it off, somebody turn that thing OFF","That whine is gonna wake every dead thing in the county","Alarm, alarm, alarm, why won't it stop","Great, now it's singing, loud as a church bell","Someone's got the whole block lit up and singing","That noise is carrying for miles, you know that, right?","Great, an alarm, so much for staying quiet","It's still going, it's still going, why is it still going?","Is that an alarm or a siren? I can't even tell anymore","Piercing, that's what it is, piercing and stupid","Something's running on battery in this town and it's screaming","Ears are ringing and it isn't even next to me","That's gonna bring them in like flies on a pie","Of all the things to still work, an alarm","Heard that? Somebody woke up the whole neighborhood","Nobody's coming to turn it off, that's the sad part","Whoever's alarm that is, they must've had money"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"No no no- make it STOP, somebody make it stop!","It's calling them, it's calling every one of them, oh God","I hate that sound, it's like screaming, a machine screaming","Shut it up, please, please somebody shut it up","They'll all come, they'll all come to the noise, it's what they do","My heart, listen to my heart, I can feel it in my throat","Somebody's coming to help? Is somebody coming? Is the police coming?","Sirens mean help, right? Right? ...no, it's just an alarm","That's a car alarm, I know that one, it's a Ford, I think","Alarm- it's an alarm- it could be someone alive over there!","Don't go near it, don't, it'll draw them to you","Are we leaving? Tell me we're leaving, I want to leave"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Alarms don't stop by themselves, battery gives out, eventually","Leave it, it'll die when the battery dies, we'll be gone","Somebody broke in somewhere to set that off, I'd bet","It's either a trap or an accident, both end the same","Count the minutes, if it's still going in ten, they're all coming","Not our alarm, not our problem, let's move","Houses with alarms had money, houses with money had guns, think about it","Just keep walking, don't even look over"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Hey, at least something in this county is still on time, heh","Somebody's mamaw forgot the code again","Bet it's old Mr Lyle's, he never could remember that code","That alarm's the loudest thing in Knox County, and I've heard my mother-in-law","Sounds like the Fourth, only with a worse song"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=rescue",{"Alarm, could be a break-in, could be somebody locked in, listen for cries","If it's an alarm, someone tripped it, could be someone hurt","Go slow, noise draws company, we'll check from a distance","Somebody's calling attention, that's what alarms are for, let's not answer"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","role=rescue_firefighter",{"That's a fire alarm if I ever heard one, that pitch, ding ding ding","Smoke detector? Fire panel? Either way, somebody's building is in trouble","Used to be that sound meant a run, now it means a risk"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=law,swat",{"Alarm call, nobody's responding, nobody's ever responding","Burglar alarm, commercial, old reflex says go see, new reflex says don't","10-31, silent, silent my ass, this thing's screaming","Nobody dispatches me anymore, funny how my feet still try to go","That's a break-in alarm, or a bored raccoon, back when","Keep your eyes up, an alarm is a flare for them AND for the people hunting us","Dispatch would've sent two units, we're all the units there are"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"We pass it, we don't touch it, we don't stop","Cut it if you can, if you can't, leave it, we've got worse"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=military,elite",{"Alarm's blaring, every dead thing for a mile heard it, stay clear","Noise discipline broken, not by us, noted","Possible attractant, avoid the area","Copy alarm, bearing unknown, don't fight them the noise","That's a civvie system, we stay out of it, over"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Don't go turn it off, that's how you walk into an ambush","Hear that? Cover your six, they're coming to it"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Go on, little alarm, sing for me, bring me the ones who come to see","Oh that's a dinner bell, that's a dinner bell and I'm not even hungry, heh","That noise draws crowds, crowds mean cover, cover means opportunity"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{"Who the fuck did that? Who set it off?","Make it stop, make it stop, I will shoot the damn thing"}},
{"HEARD_ALARM","hour=21,4",{"Alarm in the middle of the night, hell no, hell NO","Pitch black and now there's a siren, that's a hell of a night"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"A door just closed - somebody's here","Wait, I heard a door"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=law",{"Door - upstairs - stay quiet","Somebody closed a door - hold"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=swat",{"Door - second floor"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=military",{"Door noise! Hold position!"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=elite",{"Door - upstairs"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Heard a door - shut up and listen","Heard a door. Quiet, listen","Someone's in our place, someone is in OUR place","Door! Somebody's on the other side of that door!","Shut that door, shut it, keep the noise down","Get either side of the door, it's gonna open, I know it","Bring the heavy stuff, whoever's coming in, we'll be waiting"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","",{"A door just- somebody opened a door","Somebody opened a door, I heard the hinge, I did","Click, creak, that was a door","Did a door just slam, or am I hearing things?","Hear that? A latch, a latch for sure","That was a door closing, soft, careful","A door, somewhere close, shut real gentle","Somebody's inside, I heard the knob turn","That hinge needs oil, you could hear it a mile off","A screen door, I know a screen door slap anywhere","Shh, that was a door, wait for the next sound","Lock clicked, something locked a door","Back door or front door, one of them just moved","Wind or hands? I keep asking myself that"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","world=wind",{"Banging, a door swinging in the wind maybe?"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh God, I heard a door! Who's there?","The door, the door moved, did you see it move?","W-we locked that, we LOCKED that, didn't we?","That sounded like a door. Quiet, I need to listen!","I can't, I can't, I can't go look, you go look","Someone's coming in, someone's coming in, hide!","It's a trick, it's got to be a trick, doors don't open themselves","Don't open it, don't, whatever it is, don't"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Door, one floor down, we've got time","Slow, we try the lock first","Wind, maybe, probably wind, check it anyway","Only door in this place with a squeak, that's our alarm","Don't call out, watch the hall, the door tells us what we need"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad",{"Doors used to mean somebody was home","I miss when a door slamming meant a kid coming in late","Somebody went through that door once, laughing, I bet"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"If that's a ghost, he's got terrible manners","Door's got a mind of its own, same as my ex-wife","Next time knock, {g:buddy|lady}, damn"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=rescue",{"Door, someone's moving, could be someone seeking shelter","Steady, steady, if it's a patient, they'll call out","Somebody's inside, careful, we don't know if they're hurt or hunting"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=law,swat",{"Entry point, east door, possible intruder, back me up","Door moved, I'm going to check it, cover me","No lights, no noise, watch the doorway, everyone else on the walls","That door didn't move on its own, somebody's in there"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Knock first, always knock first, then open","Let him make the first move, we hold the corners"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=military,elite",{"Door breach, not ours, unknown actor, set a perimeter","Hinge noise, possible entry, holding position","A door, repeat, a door, stand by"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Come in, little rabbit, come on in, we're waiting","That door's gonna open and somebody's gonna bleed"}},
{"HEARD_DOOR","hour=21,4",{"Doors at night, damn, there's nothing worse","Door creak in the dark, that's how it always starts in the movies"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Footsteps, I hear footsteps - be quiet","Someone's walking up there - stay still"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=law",{"Footsteps - close - weapons ready","Somebody's moving around up there"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=swat",{"Movement - footsteps"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=military",{"Footsteps! Stay quiet!"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=elite",{"Footsteps - close - hold"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Footsteps - anyone expecting company?","Shh - somebody's coming","Footsteps? Good, somebody's walking into our trap","Quiet, boys, I think we got ourselves a visitor","Hear that? Some fool is wandering around, alone","That's one of theirs, that's one of the sick ones, hear the drag?","Light on his feet, that one, thief maybe, don't let him see us"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","",{"Shh- footsteps, listen, footsteps","Somebody's walking out there, hear the gravel?","That's feet, that's definitely feet","Steps, slow ones, dragging a little","I heard something shuffle, over there, did you?","Boots? Sneakers? Bare feet? Can't tell, can't tell","Quiet, quiet, there's movement","Wait, wait, don't talk, honest to God I heard walking","Tap tap tap, then nothing... I hate when it stops","Somebody's pacing, back and forth, back and forth","Something's out there, shuffling, and it isn't a deer","That's more than one set of feet, or I'm losing it","Hold on, did the floor just creak or did I imagine that?","Shuffle, shuffle, drag- yeah, that's one of them","Light steps, light, a person or a kid, not one of them","I know that walk, no I don't, I just wish I did","Hear that scraping? Listen, there it is again","Leaves cracking, hear that? Someone's treading on the leaves"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh no... somebody's out there, I heard 'em","Don't breathe, don't breathe, they'll hear me breathing","I can HEAR them, they're right outside!","It's them, it's got to be them, it's a, a, a shuffling thing","Please be somebody alive out there, please","Footsteps. Keep quiet, let me listen","W-who goes there? Who is that? Hello?? ...nobody, why is nobody answering","Every creak and I think it's the end, every creak","I'm gonna throw up, I am gonna throw up","There's more than one, there's two, three, no no no","Is it the dog? Tell me it's the dog, please, the dog","Get behind me, and not a peep","That's a shuffle, I know a shuffle, I've seen a shuffle","I can't tell if it's coming or going and that's worse","My daddy used to say you could hear a man's mood in his walk, this one's angry, I think"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Heavy tread, probably a person, boots, hear the heel?","Drag and shuffle, that's one of them, no hurry","Two sets, one fast, one slow, scavengers and a tail","Quiet, let it pass, don't give it a reason","Don't peek, don't peek, wait it out","Light steps, careful steps, hunting steps, don't like those","Not alone, there's a follower, someone behind the first","Steady steps, that's a person, the dragging ones aren't","Gravel crunches, that's what gave him away"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm|world=door",{"I'll go look, you keep the door, slow, slow"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad",{"Somebody out there is just as lost as we are","You ever listen to the footsteps and wonder if that's your neighbor?","I keep expecting to hear Billy come around the corner","Walking home, every one of them, walking home to nowhere"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"If that's the mailman, he's about two months late","Heh, someone's got a limp, bad shoes probably","Tell me that's Santa, come on, just this once"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=rescue",{"Footsteps, could be a patient, could be a threat, hold the light low","Someone's approaching, don't call out, wait and watch","Uneven gait, hurt, or one of them, keep your distance until we know","If they're hurt, I want to help, if they're not, I want to leave"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=law,swat",{"Footfalls, west side, one or two, hold your fire","Somebody's out there, check your six, then check it again","Can you tell if it's a man or a woman? I can't, not by the sound","Possible prowler, stay quiet, let him commit before we react"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=law,swat|world=door",{"Movement outside, don't lead with the light, stay behind the door"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran|world=door",{"Slow footsteps, let him come, we hold the door"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Hands on grip, no one moves, no one breathes"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=military,elite",{"Movement, direction three o'clock, footfalls, hold fire","Footsteps. We don't know who it is yet","Sound of boots, quiet, quiet, sound discipline","Steps on gravel, unidentified, standing by"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran|mood=calm",{"Wait for the visual, don't fire on a sound","Count the paces, tell me what he's carrying by the weight"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|world=door,window",{"Did you hear that? Cover the door, cover the window"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Come closer, come on closer, don't be shy","Walk right up, little lamb, walk right up","Oh, he's gonna regret that, whoever he is"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","hour=21,4",{"Footsteps at night, I really, REALLY don't like footsteps at night","Everything's louder at night, every step sounds like it's inside my head","Who walks around at this hour? Nobody good, I'll tell you that"}},
{"HEARD_FOOTSTEPS","hour=7,17",{"Someone walking in broad daylight, either brave or stupid or both","Folks out walking by day, at least I can see them coming"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Glass breaking. I don't like that sound","Did you hear that? Glass"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=law",{"Glass breaking - possible entry","Window - over there - check it"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=swat",{"Glass - rear"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=military",{"Glass breaking! Weapons up!"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=elite",{"Glass - behind us"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Glass, somebody's busting in","Heard a window go - let's look","Ha, somebody beat us to it","Smashing windows, amateurs, you take a crowbar to the door","Sounds like somebody's taking what's ours","Heh, nice sound, makes me want to go smash something too","That's some dumb son of a bitch about to cut himself open","Hey, that's our job, find who's doing it, we'll make them regret it"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","",{"Glass! Somebody broke glass!","That was a window, wasn't it?","Hear that? Smashing, like a window","Something broke, something big, glass for sure","Glass breaking, and it wasn't us","Ugh, that's a big pane, that came down hard","Shatter, then silence, I hate the silence","Window just went, I know the sound","Crash, tinkle, crash, somebody's busy","Careful, careful, glass carries","That's glass, that's glass, shh, listen","Could be somebody breaking glass. Be careful","Or a window's falling out, who knows, it's that kind of town","Bottle, maybe, or a mirror, no, definitely a window","Heard glass break, let's hold still for a second","Wasn't that the sound of someone getting in somewhere?"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"What was THAT?! Somebody's inside! Somebody's breaking in!","Glass- oh God, it's glass, something is coming through the glass!","Is it them? Is it people? I can't tell which is worse","Be quiet, be quiet, they'll hear us breathing","That was so close, I felt it in my teeth","Please let it be an animal, a cat, a raccoon, anything","Glass! Oh God, what's breaking it?","Shh... don't move, not a sound","My knees went, my actual knees"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Window, one story, not ours, somebody making a mess","Either it's a thief or it's one of them, both are bad for us","That's glass, that's metal, I'd say a car window","Someone's searching, loud, they'll get what they deserve","Quiet now, let it settle, see if anything moves"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Well, so much for that guy's security deposit","Bet the landlord's gonna be furious, heh","That's a hell of a way to say hello"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad",{"Somebody's house got broken, and probably somebody's whole life","That used to be someone's picture window"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=rescue",{"Glass, someone's hurt over there if they're lucky, hurt worse if not","Keep my eyes on the building, just in case somebody comes out bleeding","Broken glass means cuts, means infection, means me"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=law,swat",{"Break-in, possible, 10-90, hold your positions","Window smash, you take the front, I'll watch the back","Sounds like a burglary in progress, and I can't do a thing about it, can I","Possible entry, stay back, we don't know who's inside"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Glass breaks, people follow, wait for them to show","Eyes forward, hands on weapons, don't wander"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=military,elite",{"Breach noise, glass, unknown actor, hold fire, hold fire","Possible intruder, keep your distance, observe","Glass break, nothing confirmed, don't move on a sound alone","That's not us, whoever it is, they're a hostile until proven otherwise"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Someone's worked up a sweat in there, let 'em finish, then we collect","Glass is loud, loud means careless, careless means easy"}},
{"HEARD_GLASS","hour=21,4",{"Window going out at night, I really wish I hadn't heard that","Somebody's coming in, in the dark, with all that glass underfoot"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"That was a gunshot! Who's shooting?","Gunfire, somewhere close, let's keep our heads down","Did you hear that? Somebody fired a gun"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=law",{"Shot fired, north of here - stand by","Gunfire - somewhere close, could be a survivor"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=swat",{"Shot - east - marked"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=military",{"Shot fired! Sector two!","Gunfire! Eyes up!"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=elite",{"Shot - east - hold"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Heard a gun, somebody's got ammo","That's a shot, let's go see who's shooting","Ha, somebody's got a gun, welcome to the party","Hear that? Somebody else is hungry for it","Shots- is that our guys? Is that- no, no it ain't","Shoot all you want, genius, you're just ringing the dinner bell","That's amateur hour, they should know better than to fire out in the open","There's a score going down somewhere, wish it was ours","Heh, somebody's having fun without us","Fuckin' A, that came out of nowhere, jumpy bastards","Wasn't us, so who's on our turf shooting?","Hold your fire, hold it, hold it, that ain't us","That's a rifle, I know that crack, that's some rich bastard's deer gun","Somebody just spent a bullet, I'll take it off their corpse later"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","",{"Gun- that was a gun, wasn't it?","Shot! Somebody just fired a shot!","Did you hear that? Tell me you heard that","That was a gunshot, I'd bet my truck on it","Bang, just like that, somebody's got a gun out there","Another one, listen- another shot","One shot, then nothing, I hate the nothing","Shooting, somebody's shooting- hear it?","Heard that? Heard that?? That's not fireworks, not anymore","Single shot, just one, what does one mean?","Wait- shhh, shhh, listen, did it go off again?","That crack, that was a rifle, I know a rifle","Somebody's in trouble out there, or somebody's making trouble","There it goes again, bang bang, and then quiet","Great, now everything in earshot knows where that shooter is","Whoever that is, they just rang the dinner bell for every dead thing around","Gunfire, and I can't tell where from, that's the worst part","That was loud, that was LOUD, who fires like that out here?","Heh, so we're not the only ones with bullets, huh"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","world=vehicle",{"That wasn't a car backfiring, was it?"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"A gun?! That was a real gun!","Down, get down, somebody's shooting!","W-what was that? Was that a shot? That was a shot!","No no no, not shooting, I can't do shooting","Please tell me that's far away, please tell me that's far","Oh Jesus, I jumped out of my skin, my heart's going like a drum","That sound- I can't stop shaking from that sound","Is that the Army? Is that- no, the Army wouldn't shoot like that, would they?","Who's shooting? WHO'S SHOOTING?!","I'm not ready for this, I'm not ready for any of this","They're shooting people, they're actually shooting people","Was that- was that one of ours? Please don't let it be one of ours","Sh-shut up, everybody shut up, they'll hear us","Mama always said the guns would come, I didn't think she meant now","Ohhh no, nooo, there's another one, there's another-","That one rattled my teeth, my TEETH","Did somebody scream or was that me?","I felt that one in my chest","My ears are ringing and it wasn't even our gun","Somebody's dying out there and we're just standing here","Don't go that way, please don't go toward it","It's like the Fourth all over again, only nobody's laughing","I want my daddy, I'm sorry, I know that's stupid, I want my daddy"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear|world=building",{"Come on, come on, let's go somewhere with walls"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear|world=window",{"Back up, back up, back away from the windows"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Rifle, mid-range, bolt action maybe, not our problem","Single shot, spaced out, somebody's hunting something","Let it be, we don't know who it is, we don't want to know","Gunfire's carrying more now, it'll draw them too","Noted, then back to what we were doing","Gunfire's no invitation, I'm staying put","Ain't ours, so keep your head down and your feet moving","Two-two-two, that's a deer rifle, I've heard it every November","Somebody's trying to prove something, and they'll pay for it by dark","Shot's gonna bring company, and not the kind with casseroles","Count them, tell me how many you hear","Hold still a second, let's hear where the next one comes from","Pistol, no, rifle, hell, I can't tell anymore","Don't run toward it, don't run away from it, just stay put","Yeah, I heard it, I'm not gonna jump anymore, I used to jump"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm|world=door",{"A shot is a good reason to check the doors"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad",{"Somebody's still got bullets and somebody's still got a reason","Every shot out there is a person, you know that? A person-","Sounds like a Fourth of July that never ended","That's somebody's last bullet, I bet, that's somebody's last","I keep thinking it's somebody else's husband","They're not shooting at birds, are they?","I don't want to know what they were shooting at","Hope it was quick, whatever it was","God help whoever's on the other end of that"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad|world=door",{"Used to be that sound meant deer season, daddy's boots by the door"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Well, that's the dinner bell, anyone want to go say hi? Anyone? Nope","Somebody's having a worse day than us, that's almost nice, heh","If I'm gonna get shot, can it be after lunch at least?","There goes my nap","Pop pop, heh, it's the redneck wake-up call","Sounds like Bubba finally found the shotgun shells","Somebody go tell them to use a silencer, they're gonna wake the dead, oh wait"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=rescue",{"Gunfire, somebody could be hurt, keep your kit within reach","If that was a hit, there's a patient out there","Shot fired, get down!","I hate that sound, I hate what comes after it","Count them, if it keeps going somebody's down","That sound means I'm needed or I'm too late, never in between","Bag's ready, just in case someone's calling for help out there","Medics don't run toward a shooter, I keep reminding myself"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","role=rescue_medical|mood=sad",{"Gunshot wound, chest, probably, they're always chest in my head","Four hours of training and none of it says what to do about THAT"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","role=rescue_clergy",{"Lord, whoever that was, whoever pulled the trigger, have mercy","Say a word for whoever's out there, I will, for both sides"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","role=rescue_firefighter|world=vehicle,stairs",{"Fire engines, ladders, I'd take that over this noise any day"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Shots mean hurt people, hurt people mean us, saddle up"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=law,swat",{"Shots fired, shots fired, somebody log the time","Check your weapon, that wasn't a backfire","Sheriff's office would've been out there by now, back when","That's gunfire, stay behind something solid","Gunshot- direction, anyone? Anybody got direction?","Hold your fire, hold your fire, we don't know who's who out there","Down, get down, heads low!","Shots, probably domestic, probably desperate, probably both","Radio, anybody on the radio? Nobody, that figures","It's a rifle, I don't like it, they've got range on us"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran|mood=calm",{"Single report, no return fire, somebody's alone out there","Gunshot, direction unknown, keep it moving, nobody stops","Nobody panics, we hold what we've got","Twenty-two years I've heard that sound and it never gets better","That's a thirty-aught-six, no mistake, deer season in July"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=law,swat|mood=grim",{"Used to be I'd pull my cruiser around and go see, now I just listen","Someone's about to be arrested by gravity","There's no 911 for this one"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=law,swat|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Was that- that was a shot, right? Right?","Do I- do we go? Sarge? Do we go check?","My hands are sweating, that was a gun and I'm scared of it, say it out loud, I'm scared"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=military,elite",{"Report, single, small caliber, no follow-up, over","Shots, bearing unknown, noted","Trouble? Nope, just noise, eyes up","Gunfire at our six, maybe, keep it tight","Echo makes it hard to tell, I hate this town for echoes","Somebody's burning ammo, we're not taking the bait","Did that sound like friendlies to you? Me neither","Copy shots, no visual, hold position","Rifle shot, civilian, hunting rifle, not us","It's a noisy county, that's what the briefing didn't say"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran|mood=calm",{"Don't flinch, don't point, just listen for the second shot","That's a thirty-aught, deer rifle, civilian","Single shot means one shooter, two means he's got friends","We hear it, we log it, we move on, that's all"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=military,elite|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Sir- Sarge- was that at us? Was that at US?","They're shooting at the Army, they're shooting at the Army, this isn't right","Breathe, just breathe... it's a gun, I got one too"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=military,elite|tmp=fresh|mood=fear|world=fence",{"Oh man, I signed up for fence duty, not this"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Whoever that is, I hope they're good, I like it when they're good","A shot. I don't want to know who got hurt","Let 'em shoot, let 'em bleed, we'll pick up the shells","Easy pickings come running when they fire like that","Free noise, free target, I love a stupid neighbor"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=fear",{"Jesus, that was close, I felt the air move","We're not alone out here, I told you, I TOLD you","Don't make a sound, don't breathe, they'll shoot us too","Shit, shit, SHIT, that was too close"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{"Who the fuck is shooting? Who's shooting on OUR block?","Tell them to shut their goddamn mouth, I mean the gun","Some idiot's gonna get us all killed, Jesus Christ"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","hour=21,4",{"Gunshot in the dark, nothing worse, nothing at all worse","At night a shot sounds like it's in your bedroom","Couldn't see where it came from if I tried, the dark swallows it","I don't like a shot after sundown, you can't see what's coming for it","Gunshot at night, so somebody's either brave or dumb or both"}},
{"HEARD_GUNSHOT","hour=7,17",{"Broad daylight and they're shooting, that takes nerve","Sun's out and somebody's already pulling triggers","Daytime shot, so they can see what they're aiming at, that's worse","More shots at noon, as if the heat wasn't enough"}},
