{"HEARD_VOICE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hear that? People talking","Somebody's yapping up there - let's see","Voices, ha, people, good, we've been bored","Shh, someone's out there, shut up and listen","They're not even trying to be quiet, the idiots","Hear that? They're having a nice little chat, how sweet","Loud people have loot, loud people are slow"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","",{"Voices! I heard voices!","Someone's talking, shh, listen","Wait, that was a voice, a real one","Somebody's out there, I heard them mumble","Talking, it was talking, it was","A voice, a woman's voice, or a kid's, I can't tell","Hold on, hold on, somebody said something, way off","Arguing, hear that? Two of them, arguing","Singing? Is somebody actually singing?","Laughter, there's laughing out there, who's laughing?","Radio, maybe? Is that a radio? A voice on a radio?","Cry, a cry for help, that's a cry for help","Man talking low, real low, trying not to be heard"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","world=wind",{"Whispering, hear that whispering? That's not the wind"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"Oh God, there's people, there's other people","Is that- is that someone we know? Hello?? HELLO??","Don't answer, don't answer, we don't know who it is","Could be help... or could be the worst, I can't tell","They're talking so calm, why are they so calm?","My heart can't take another surprise","Someone's coming, someone's coming, what do we do","I want to yell back and I'm terrified to"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=warm",{"A voice! Somebody else is ALIVE out there!","Voices, real voices, I almost cried, I did cry","Another human being, I can't believe it, another one","Please be nice, please be a nice person, please"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Talking means people, people mean trouble or trade","Quiet, let's hear what they're saying before we show ourselves","Voices carry, so do ours, keep it low","Don't wave, don't shout, let them come to us if they will","They sound easy, no urgency, probably just a camp"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=sad",{"Somebody's still talking, that's something","That voice sounded like my brother, for a second, only for a second","It's been so long since I've heard anyone but us"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"Hey, sounds like a neighborhood barbecue, minus the barbecue","Somebody's arguing about a football game, I bet, heh","That's the first sane-sounding conversation all week, bless 'em"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","reg=rescue",{"A voice, could be hurt, keep still, listen for pain","Call to them quietly, they may need help, they may be afraid","If somebody's calling, we answer, carefully, from cover"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","role=rescue_clergy",{"Voices in the dark, Lord, let it be gentle voices"}},
{"HEARD_VOICE","reg=law,swat",{"Voices, possible suspects, possible victims, hold your position","Talking, not shouting, not hostile, steady","Hear the tone? That's calm, they're not on edge, not yet","Radio check, maybe? Is that radio traffic? Quiet, quiet, listen","A voice. I can't tell who it is"}},
